Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:31.18,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,900)\bord4\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs70\i0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HF517D4&\shad0}Se eu fosse {\fs85\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HF517D4&}10 anos mais nova...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:35.68,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1800,160)\b0\fnBerlin Sans FB\bord4\fs60}Fale sobre o Mizuhara-san
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:34.35,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,900)\bord4\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs70\i0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HF517D4&\shad0}Diria que é do tipo que {\fs85\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HF517D4&}queremos proteger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:35.68,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,900)\bord4\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs85\i0\c&H6B6CFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}Os olhos dele são uma graça!
